// ║ • Prospective reaction studies measure MFE, MAE and ATR response.         ║
// ║ • Empirical climate priors replace the false 50/50 clean-route assumption.║
// ║ • Confidence bands adapt to the observed, frozen confidence distribution.║
// ║ • Utility credits profitable round trips without relabeling them CLEAN.   ║
// ║ • ROM Legacy and Canonical grids are compared on identical events.       ║
// ║ • 0.728 and 1.328 receive dedicated hidden-gem evidence tracking.         ║
// ║ • Trend/chop cohorts expose regime dependence instead of one pooled mean.║
// ║ • Evidence-weighted glow rewards tested levels without changing signals. ║
// ║ • Dynamic final alerts protect the 64-plot budget.                        ║
// ║ • Four event types are separated into bullish and bearish cohorts.        ║
// ║ • Fast, medium and final horizons expose response stability through time. ║
// ║ • Bayesian shrinkage and Wilson bounds prevent small-sample overconfidence.║
// ║ • Event-recency weighting follows regime change without erasing history.  ║
// ║ • Evidence quality combines probability, MFE, MAE and final response.     ║
// ║ • EARLY, DEVELOPING and TRUSTED tiers translate statistical maturity.     ║
// ║ • ATR warm-up gating prevents tick-denominator contamination.             ║
// ║ • Horizon-scaled robust statistics preserve truth without outlier capture.║
// ║ • Completed cohorts route PHI events into FOLLOW, FADE, WAIT or LEARN.     ║
// ║ • Regime-aware ATR expectancy remains advisory unless confirmation is set.║
// ║ • Concurrent audits freeze each mature route before any future bars exist. ║
// ║ • Router, original PHI and actionable Council directions share one horizon.║
// ║ • FOLLOW, FADE, WAIT, horizons and confidence bands are scored separately. ║
// ║ • Ordered passage separates clean wins, round trips, losses and ambiguity. ║
// ║ • Raw observations are shown, while de-clustered events drive edge claims. ║
// ║ • WAIT measures useful abstention versus missed clean directional movement. ║
// ║ • Frozen pre-event forecasts give Brier calibration genuine forward truth. ║
// ║ • Frozen climatology exposes real Brier skill instead of raw score theatre. ║
// ║ • Clean, round-trip, loss, whipsaw and quiet form one calibrated forecast.  ║
// ║ • Timestamp geometry keeps weekly anchors safe on one-minute chart history. ║
// ║ • FOLLOW and FADE keep independent fast, medium and final horizon curves.  ║
// ║ • Round trips separate profitable recoveries from damaging reversals.       ║
// ║ • Welford moments stabilize online confidence-band variance.                 ║
// ║ • One control plus Memory, PHI and Combined arms share identical events.      ║
